  COA_MissionDescriptor "{64425051F2E00216}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "You were ambushed in the city, and lost your accompanying mechanized force. Your ultimate goal is to get to FOS Taji. However, you were sent into Fallujah to uncover enemy tunnel networks, and destroy weapon caches. How many can you get before you leave?"\
   ""\
   "Notes"\
   "-You have 2 respawn waves, activated by the ranking leadership in an admin chat. Rally points are enabled. You have an m777 battery to support you. You have an ammunition truck. "
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Blufor was ambushed and lost their vehicles in Fallujah. They are hunting down tunnel networks, and weapon caches on foot. Stop them"\
   ""\
   "Notes"\
   "- You have 1 respawn wave, triggered by the ranking leadership. Do not approach within 300 meters of FOS Tajin. Obey the rule of 2. "
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
